{"availability":"available","full":"mertertek/secret-table-game","name":"secret-table-game","description":"3D social-deduction game for 5-10 friends in the browser, based on the rules of Secret Hitler. First-person table, hand gestures, TR/EN. React + three.js + Supabase + Vercel.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-13T20:51:49Z","updated":"2026-09-19T12:37:48Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://secret-table-game-web.vercel.app","topics":["3d-game","browser-game","multiplayer","react-three-fiber","secret-hitler","social-deduction","supabase","threejs","typescript"],"demo":"https://secret-table-game-web.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.592Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.592Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.592Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T08:58:27.592Z","stars":8,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A 3D social-deduction game for 5–10 friends, played in the browser at a shared virtual table.","Based on the rules of Secret Hitler · first-person view · hand gestures · Turkish and English UI · no accounts, no install.","Secret Table puts your group around one table in a 1930s back room. Everyone sits in a chair, looks around in first person, points, waves and claps with real hands, and plays the full ruleset of Secret Hitler: elections, legislative sessions, the election tracker, presidential powers, veto, and the two ways each side can win."],"features":["A real table, not a lobby. Round table, eight parametric characters with three skin","tones, name plates, envelopes, policy cards and both boards, all generated in code.","First person. Turn your head, look at your neighbours, lean over the boards (B),","and hold your own cards in your hands. Other players see your head move.","Hand gestures. A radial wheel (G) with eight emotes: point, hands up, thumbs up"],"sourceUrl":